# FORCED arms (no shipped SPNK, no registered states): a SpankWeed spawned in 08_sand_casualpirates
# with a borrowed SpacePirate body (ANCS u04d0, character 1, anim 34), wake/search/attack radii
# 30/20/10, hurtSleepDelay 2.  Messages from send, shots from damage, then Delete.
# @f335: no ANCS, so LoadSpankWeed gets an empty model and returns null (0x4F4 arm).
# Run with tools/cov/specs/spankweed.py (its header has the command line).
@f300 god 1
@f330 spawn SPNK ancs u04d0 1 34 prop 835adca1 30.0 prop ed9bf5a3 20.0 prop 7c11b995 10.0 prop 9b5a4744 2.0
@f335 spawn SPNK
@f340 send e0036ff00 Activate; objs spankweed
@f342 place e0036ff00 player 6
@f360 damage e0036ff00 5
@f370 send e0036ff00 Decrement
@f380 send e0036ff00 HitObject from player
@f390 send e0036ff00 AIUpdateDisabled
@f400 send e0036ff00 Deactivate
@f410 send e0036ff00 Activate
@f420 damage e0036ff00 5 kb missile
@f600 covdump
@f700 send e0036ff00 Delete
@f800 covdump
